s one body with the Double-Faced Specter. Guided by the most powerful of sorcerers, Gojou Satoru, Itadori is admitted to the Tokyo Metropolitan Technical High School of Sorcery, an organization that fights the Curses... and thus begins the heroic tale of a boy who became a Curse to exorcise a Curse, a life from which he could never turn back.\\n<br><br>\\n(Source: Crunchyroll)<br>\\n<br>\\n<i>Note: The first episode received an early web premiere on September 19th, 2020. The regular TV broadcast started on October 3rd, 2020.</i>", "mainStudios": {"nodes": [{"name": "MAPPA", "isAnimationStudio": true}]}, "averageScore": 84, "externalLinks": [{"url": "https://jujutsukaisen.jp/", "site": "Official Site", "type": "INFO"}, {"url": "https://twitter.com/animejujutsu", "site": "Twitter", "type": "SOCIAL"}, {"url": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/jujutsu-kaisen", "site": "Crunchyroll", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.netflix.com/title/81278456", "site": "Netflix", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.iq.com/album/igc33vhvex", "site": "iQ", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.bilibili.tv/media/37738", "site": "Bilibili TV", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://twitter.com/Jujutsu_anime", "site": "Twitter", "type": "SOCIAL"}, {"url": "https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxSscENEp7JisDU6GAJuyNpVwDvCm-f3J", "site": "YouTube", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://twitter.com/Jujutsu_Kaisen_", "site": "Twitter", "type": "SOCIAL"}, {"url": "https://www.hulu.com/series/jujutsu-kaisen-382ec8bf-3650-4cde-94db-ecd18665f9e0", "site": "Hulu", "type": "STREAMING"}], "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "recommendations": {"nodes": [{"rating": 3365, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 101922, "title": {"native": "鬼滅の刃", "romaji": "Kimetsu no Yaiba", "english": "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba"}, "format": "TV", "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Drama", "Fantasy", "Supernatural"], "status": "FINISHED", "isAdult": false, "episodes": 26, "meanScore": 82, "startDate": {"year": 2019}, "co