 also having problems with his Titan transformation, and a deadly killer has been hired to secure Eren and Historia, one Levi knows all too well from his youth.<br>\\n<br>\\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "mainStudios": {"nodes": [{"name": "WIT STUDIO", "isAnimationStudio": true}]}, "averageScore": 86, "externalLinks": [{"url": "http://shingeki.tv/season3/", "site": "Official Site", "type": "INFO"}, {"url": "https://twitter.com/anime_shingeki", "site": "Twitter", "type": "SOCIAL"}, {"url": "http://www.crunchyroll.com/attack-on-titan", "site": "Crunchyroll", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.hulu.com/attack-on-titan", "site": "Hulu", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.adultswim.com/videos/attack-on-titan", "site": "Adult Swim", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.iq.com/album/2c19tvbcbux", "site": "iQ", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.netflix.com/title/70299043", "site": "Netflix", "type": "STREAMING"}, {"url": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/attack-on-titan-dubs", "site": "Crunchyroll", "type": "STREAMING"}], "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "recommendations": {"nodes": [{"rating": 61, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 101759, "title": {"native": "約束のネバーランド", "romaji": "Yakusoku no Neverland", "english": "The Promised Neverland"}, "format": "TV", "genres": ["Drama", "Fantasy", "Horror", "Mystery", "Psychological", "Thriller"], "status": "FINISHED", "isAdult": false, "episodes": 12, "meanScore": 83, "startDate": {"year": 2019}, "coverImage": {"color": "#e4ae50", "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101759-8UR7r9MNVpz2.jpg", "extraLarge": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101759-8UR7r9MNVpz2.jpg"}, "popularity": 642198, "bannerImage": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101759-MhlCoeqnODso.jpg", "averageScore": 83}}, {"rating": 57, "mediaRecommendation": {"id": 101348, "title": {"native": "ヴィンランド・サガ", "romaji": "VINLAND SAGA", "english": "Vinland Saga"}, "for